* {{IPA|de|[ˈkiːɐ̯çə]|a=some speakers in Westphalia}}
* {{audio|de|De-Kirche.ogg|audio (Germany)}}
* {{audio|de|De-at-Kirche.ogg|audio (Austria)}}

